        "server": "uvicorn"
      },
      "body": "\"This template is designed to be professional, clear, and reassuring. You can choose the version that best matches your company's tone (Formal, Standard, or Friendly).\\n\\n***\\n\\n## Option 1: Standard & Professional (Recommended)\\n\\n**Subject:** Confirmation: Your Subscription Update Has Been Successful\\n\\n**Dear [Customer Name],**\\n\\nWe are pleased to confirm that your subscription has been successfully updated as requested.\\n\\n**Details of the Update:**\\n*   **Subscription Plan:** [New Plan Name/Tier, e.g., Premium Tier]\\n*   **Effective Date:** [Date of Update]\\n*   **Changes Included:** [Briefly list the main benefit, e.g., Access to new reporting features and increased storage capacity.]\\n\\nYour updated subscription is now active and fully effective. You can review all the details and access your new features within your account dashboard here: [Link to Customer Dashboard/Billing Portal]\\n\\nIf you have any questions about your new plan, or if you require any further assistance, please do not hesitate to reply to this email or contact our support team at [Support Phone Number] or [Support Email Address].\\n\\nThank you for being a valued customer of [Your Company Name].\\n\\n**Sincerely,**\\n\\nThe [Your Company Name] Support Team\\n\\n***\\n\\n## Option 2: Formal & Detailed (Good for Enterprise/Complex Updates)\\n\\n**Subject:** Account Status Confirmation: Successful Subscription Modification\\n\\n**Dear [Customer Name],**\\n\\nThis email serves to formally confirm the successful processing of your recent subscription modification.\\n\\nWe have successfully updated your account details, effective [Date of Update], to reflect the following changes:\\n\\n*   **Previous Plan:** [Old Plan Name]\\n*   **New Plan:** [New Plan Name]\\n*   **Billing Cycle Adjustment:** [Specify any billing change, e.g., Monthly billing initiated.]\\n*   **Feature Access:** [Detailed summary of new features or access rights.]\\n\\nAll necessary changes have been implemented on our end, and your access to the new features is now available. You may find a detailed breakdown of your updated plan within the [Link to Billing/Account Settings Page].\\n\\nShould you have any concerns regarding this change or require personalized assistance, please reference your account number [Account Number] when contacting our dedicated support line at [Support Phone Number].\\n\\nWe appreciate your continued business.\\n\\n**Respectfully,**\\n\\n[Your Name/Title, or The Customer Success Team]\\n[Your Company Name]\\n\\n***\\n\\n## Option 3: Friendly & Casual (Good for Startups/Creative Brands)\\n\\n**Subject:** 🎉 Good News! Your Subscription is All Set!\\n\\n**Hi [Customer Name],**\\n\\nGreat news! We’ve just successfully updated your subscription, and everything is running smoothly.\\n\\nYour new [New Plan Name] is now active, and you can start enjoying [Mention the primary benefit, e.g., all the premium features] right away!\\n\\n**What you need to know:**\\n*   **New Plan:** [New Plan Name]\\n*   **When it started:** [Date]\\n*   **Check it out:** Log into your dashboard here: [Link to Customer Dashboard]\\n\\nIf you have any questions at all or need a hand exploring your new features, just hit reply! We’re here to help.\\n\\nHappy [Using Your Product/Service]!\\n\\n**Best regards,**\\n\\n[Your Name]\\n[Your Company Name] Support\"",
